args: { mechanisms: DebtMechanismHypothesis[], campaign: DebtCampaignRequest }
returns: DebtImprovementPackage[]
---
Turn only supported mechanisms into packages with a bounded behavior change, explicit non-goals, accountable interface owner, and measurable acceptance evidence. Before cleanup, discover undocumented integrations and affected consumers. Where discovery widens the work, publish the changed scope and rebaseline instead of hiding a rewrite inside the original package.
